A||||4||owenslee||4.9 Cadillac Engine Info / Casting #s/ rebuild proceedures||||7||
Z||000000||owenslee||04-11-2001||01:39 AM||||For those interested in the 4.x series of Cadillac engines, the link below will take you to two articles published in the June and July 1994 Issues of "Automotive Rebuilder" and authored by Doug Anderson, Vice President of Grooms Engines in Nashville. <P>Note that this is the same Grooms Engine supplying the quality 3.4 Camaro engines to Ed Parks and others for Fiero conversions. <BR>( Call Grooms and ask for Keith regarding the 3.4 conversion)<P>"Automotive Rebuilder" is a trade publication for Professional Engine Builders and all credit for this pair of articles belongs to them and Mr. Anderson.<P>The first article covers differences between engines, casting numbers, and means of identification.<P>The second article covers the rebuilding proceedures unique to this engine. All rebuilding info is provided by Engine Masters of Excelsior Springs, MO. They are acknowledged by many in the engine industry as the EXPERTS on remanufacturing this engine and have more experience with it than anyone outside of GM. <P>Note the several ads that are included for K-Line and Engine Masters with specific emphasis on the 4.x engine series.<P>I offer this information to assist all those interested in this conversion for their Fiero.<P>I also sent these articles to BubbaJoe in Canada and expect that he will include this information for reference on his Cadillac / Fiero web page.<P>Enjoy....<BR> <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=1609125&a=12542234" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=1609125&a=12542234</A> <P><BR>Kerry Owen<P>O/M Performance Engineering<P>------------------<BR>"Badges?...Badges..??? We don gat to sho yu no stinkin' BADGES..!!!"<P><p>[This message has been edited by owenslee (edited 04-11-2001).]||||reg||7
Z||000001||Wade87GT||04-11-2001||09:18 AM||||owenslee,<BR>Thanks for the lead on some great info. Hopefully those back issues are still available.<P>Wade||||reg||14
